{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/12","id":5309769943,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVjVyDc8AAAABPHyo1w","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/12","diff_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/12.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/12.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/issues/12","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/12/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/12/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/issues/12/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/statuses/607647ec0325eaf56bd58a4c2283aedaa47e7e68","number":12,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: complete owner MFA enrollment and sign-in challenges","user":{"login":"productionhome2022-hash","id":348720557,"node_id":"U_kgDOFMkNrQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348720557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Owner authentication hardening\n\nThe audit found that the backend required a second-factor claim for sensitive owner callables, but the Flutter sign-in screen did not resolve Firebase's MFA challenge. This could lock the real owner out after enrolling MFA.\n\n### Changes\n- Upgrade `firebase_auth` to `^5.8.0` for cross-platform TOTP MFA support; the existing lock refresh workflow will resolve and commit `pubspec.lock`.\n- Handle `FirebaseAuthMultiFactorException` during email/password sign-in.\n- Prefer TOTP when available; support SMS as a fallback for accounts enrolled with a phone factor. Unknown factor types fail closed; there is no MFA bypass.\n- Add a mandatory owner-only enrollment gate before the app opens. If the platformOwner claim is present but no second factor is enrolled, the owner must reauthenticate with password, enroll a TOTP authenticator, and sign in again so Firebase issues a true MFA-authenticated session.\n- The TOTP secret is kept in the enrollment screen state only and is not written to Firestore or application logs.\n\n### External prerequisites / validation limits\n- Firebase Authentication with Identity Platform and TOTP MFA must be enabled for the Firebase project.\n- Owner account provisioning, MFA enrollment, recovery factor, and a real second-factor sign-in still require non-production Firebase acceptance. No owner claim or MFA factor was provisioned in production.\n- CI analysis/build and emulator validation are pending after the dependency lock refresh.\n- No merge to `main` or production deployment is included.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-14T09:36:04Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:11:31Z","closed_at":"2